  "title": "Low-Cholesterol Blueberry Muffins",
  "description": "These low-cholesterol muffins pack great blueberry punch. Non-fat milk, egg white, and polyunsaturated oil add a healthy twist to quick bread treats.",
  "authors": [
    "JJOHN32"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-08-10T13:58:40-04:00",
